4bc41efe><!--[--><picture class="carousel-image active" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper1.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper1.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper2.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper2.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper3.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper3.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper4.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper4.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper5.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper5.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper6.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper6.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><picture class="carousel-image" data-v-4bc41efe><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_mb_swiper7.webp" data-v-4bc41efe><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/u1_pc_swiper7.webp" alt="Multi-material model printed on Snapmaker U1 multicolor 3D printer, highlighting faster print time and reduced filament waste." data-v-4bc41efe></picture><!--]--></div><div class="progress-container" data-v-4bc41efe><div class="progress-track" data-v-4bc41efe><!--[--><div class="active progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><div class="progress-segment" data-v-4bc41efe></div><!--]--></div></div><div style="display:none;" class="nav-arrows" data-v-4bc41efe><button class="arrow-btn prev-btn" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:transparent;" data-v-4bc41efe><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" data-v-4bc41efe><circle opacity="0.2" cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="black" data-v-4bc41efe></circle><path d="M26.8995 14.1005L17 24L26.8995 33.8995" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-4bc41efe></path></svg></button><button class="arrow-btn next-btn" data-v-4bc41efe><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" data-v-4bc41efe><circle opacity="0.2" cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="black" data-v-4bc41efe></circle><path d="M21.1005 33.8995L31 24L21.1005 14.1005" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-4bc41efe></path></svg></button></div></section><!----><!----><!----><div class="bg-black"><section class="hero-img-banner hero-img-banner--fullscreen" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__fullscreen" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__bg-wrapper" data-v-83b25586><video class="hero-img-banner__bg-video" muted autoplay loop playsinline webkit-playsinline data-v-83b25586><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Switch%20Filaments%20in%205%20Seconds%20with%20snapswap.webm" type="video/webm" data-v-83b25586></video></div><div class="hero-img-banner__overlay--top hero-img-banner__overlay" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__content" data-v-83b25586><h2 class="hero-img-banner__title hero-img-banner__title--html" style="" data-v-83b25586><span data-v-83b25586><span class='snapswap-gradient'>SnapSwap™，5 秒换料</span>（全屏）</span></h2><div class="hero-img-banner__desc--html hero-img-banner__desc" style="color:#fff;" data-v-83b25586><div data-v-83b25586><span class='desc-normal'>传统单头 3D 打印机切换耗材时依赖换料系统，每次换料都需要冲刷旧料，冲刷总耗时甚至远超打印本身。</span> <span class='desc-bold'>SnapSwap™系统</span><span class='desc-normal'> 可为 4 枚打印头预装载独立的耗材并提前加热，通过换头切换耗材，将单次切换时长从 2 分钟缩短至</span> <span class='desc-bold'>5 秒。多材料创作，从未如此高效畅快<sup>[2]</sup></span><span class='desc-normal'>。</span></div></div><!----></div></div></div></section><section class="video-text-section reverse-layout" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>告别换料冲刷</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>传统单头 3D 打印机通过换料系统切换耗材时，需要进行“冲刷”，即用新耗材把喷嘴中残留的旧耗材挤出、排空，无疑会浪费大量完好的材料。而 U1 打破了这一局限：只在开始新打印任务，或是流量校准时清理极少量已劣化的耗材，每次打印节约耗材量可达  80%<sup>[4]</sup> 。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><!----></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section><section class="video-text-section" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>稳固、精准的换头结构</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>U1 巧妙地引入钢球定位耦合结构，无需依靠螺丝、磁铁和额外的电机，即可确保打印头转换器抓取打印头时，能精准结合并牢固锁定。100 万+ 次切换测试零故障，既快，又稳。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><!----></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section><!--[--><div class="snmk-container mt-3xl" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="do-in-one" data-v-2d8d86b8><h2 class="page-t-c page-t1" style="color:#FFCD00;" data-v-2d8d86b8>耗材宝贵，拒绝浪费</h2><div class="dio-desc page-f1" style="" data-v-2d8d86b8><span class='doinone-desc-normal'>冲刷的浪费程度，可能远超你的想象——使用其他单头打印机打印一个多色模型时，用于冲刷的耗材量，可能达到模型本身用量的 </span> <span class='doinone-desc-bold'>3 至 4 倍。</span> <span class='doinone-desc-normal'>U1 通过智能换头系统避免冲刷，</span> <span class='doinone-desc-bold'>大幅减少浪费，省钱又环保。</span></div></div></div></div><div class="snmk-container" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="dio-video" data-v-2d8d86b8><video muted autoplay webkit-playsinline playsinline loop data-v-2d8d86b8><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Less%20Waste%20Means%20Serious%20Savings..webm" data-v-2d8d86b8></video></div></div></div><!----><!--]--><section class="three-card-carousel" data-v-51f09c85><div class="header-section" data-v-51f09c85><h2 class="section-title" data-v-51f09c85>用 U1，一年能省多少？</h2><!----></div><div class="cards-grid" style="" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><div data-v-51f09c85><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(min-width:768px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/PC_Toys.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture></div><div data-v-51f09c85><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(min-width:768px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/PC_Merchandise.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture></div><div data-v-51f09c85><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(min-width:768px) and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/PC_Life Hacks.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture></div><!--]--></div><div style="display:none;" class="swiper-container" data-v-51f09c85><div class="swiper carousel-swiper" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide three-card" data-swiper-slide-index="0" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/mob_Toys.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture><!----><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide three-card" data-swiper-slide-index="1" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/mob_Merchandise.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture><!----><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide three-card" data-swiper-slide-index="2" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><picture data-v-51f09c85><source media="(-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio:2)" data-v-51f09c85><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/mob_Life Hacks.webp" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-51f09c85></picture><!----><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div></div><nav class="pager" style="display:none;" data-v-51f09c85><!--[--><button class="dot active" aria-label="跳到第 1 张" data-v-51f09c85></button><button class="dot" aria-label="跳到第 2 张" data-v-51f09c85></button><button class="dot" aria-label="跳到第 3 张" data-v-51f09c85></button><!--]--></nav><p class="notion" data-v-51f09c85>“其他”指使用换料系统切换耗材的 3D 打印机。</p><p class="desc" data-v-51f09c85>基于使用平均价格 50 元/kg 的 PLA 耗材、每周打印一件的前提计算得出。</p><div class="u1-go-link" data-v-51f09c85><a href="/snapmaker-u1/calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero-cta-button hero-cta-button-outline" data-v-51f09c85>算算我能省多少</a></div></section><div class="custom-hero-section"><div class="custom-hero-content"><h2 class="custom-hero-title" style="color:#ffcd00;">性能，色彩，由你定义</h2><div class="custom-hero-desc" style="color:#c2c2c2;">U1 拥有四个独立的打印头，让您可以自由混合搭配材料，使每个部件都有自己的功能，或者使用低粘附性组合使拆除支撑变得轻而易举。</div></div></div><div class="video-tab-section reverse theme-dark" data-v-9a652e31><div class="block-text mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="u1-title" data-v-9a652e31>混合材料，轻松拆支撑</div></div><div class="wrapper-video-list" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><div class="active wrapper-video" data-v-9a652e31><video src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Mix%20Materials%20for%20Easy-to-Remove%20Supports.webm" playsinline muted preload="none" data-v-9a652e31></video></div><div class="wrapper-video" data-v-9a652e31><video src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Water-soluble.webm" playsinline muted preload="none" data-v-9a652e31></video></div><!--]--></div><div class="wrapper-ct" data-v-9a652e31><div class="block-text desktop-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="u1-title" data-v-9a652e31>混合材料，轻松拆支撑</div></div><div class="sub-text-group-list desktop-only" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><div class="active sub-text-group" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text" data-v-9a652e31><span data-v-9a652e31>PETG 支撑：稳固承托，拆卸不伤面</span><svg class="icon-dropdown" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" data-v-9a652e31><circle opacity="0.1" cx="12" cy="12" r="12" transform="rotate(90 12 12)" fill="#DFDFDF" data-v-9a652e31></circle><path d="M17.3994 14.2295C17.4047 14.4275 17.3334 14.62 17.2002 14.7666C17.0668 14.9132 16.8814 15.0033 16.6836 15.0166C16.486 15.0298 16.2904 14.9662 16.1387 14.8389L16.1348 14.835L16.0957 14.7988L16.0898 14.7939L16.0908 14.793L11.9668 10.7021L7.91211 14.79C7.77697 14.9261 7.59583 15.0065 7.4043 15.0156C7.21246 15.0247 7.02353 14.9618 6.87598 14.8389L6.87207 14.835L6.83203 14.7988L6.82617 14.7939L6.82715 14.793C6.69113 14.6577 6.6096 14.4768 6.60059 14.2852C6.59168 14.0935 6.65543 13.9052 6.77832 13.7578L6.78125 13.7539L6.81738 13.7139L6.82227 13.708L6.82324 13.708L11.417 9.07715C11.5523 8.9409 11.734 8.85965 11.9258 8.85059C12.1176 8.84156 12.3056 8.90539 12.4531 9.02832L12.458 9.03125L12.498 9.06738L12.5029 9.07227L17.1719 13.7041L17.2656 13.8174C17.3483 13.9383 17.3954 14.081 17.3994 14.2295Z" fill="#7F7F7F" stroke="#7F7F7F" stroke-width="0.3" data-v-9a652e31></path></svg></div><div class="expanded wrapper-overflow" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>PETG 在打印中更抗翘曲、支撑更稳；拆除更顺手，减少撬动与表面损伤。</div><!----><!----></div></div><div class="sub-text-group" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text" data-v-9a652e31><span data-v-9a652e31>PVA 水溶支撑：泡一泡就干净</span><svg class="icon-dropdown" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" data-v-9a652e31><circle opacity="0.1" cx="12" cy="12" r="12" transform="rotate(90 12 12)" fill="#DFDFDF" data-v-9a652e31></circle><path d="M17.3994 14.2295C17.4047 14.4275 17.3334 14.62 17.2002 14.7666C17.0668 14.9132 16.8814 15.0033 16.6836 15.0166C16.486 15.0298 16.2904 14.9662 16.1387 14.8389L16.1348 14.835L16.0957 14.7988L16.0898 14.7939L16.0908 14.793L11.9668 10.7021L7.91211 14.79C7.77697 14.9261 7.59583 15.0065 7.4043 15.0156C7.21246 15.0247 7.02353 14.9618 6.87598 14.8389L6.87207 14.835L6.83203 14.7988L6.82617 14.7939L6.82715 14.793C6.69113 14.6577 6.6096 14.4768 6.60059 14.2852C6.59168 14.0935 6.65543 13.9052 6.77832 13.7578L6.78125 13.7539L6.81738 13.7139L6.82227 13.708L6.82324 13.708L11.417 9.07715C11.5523 8.9409 11.734 8.85965 11.9258 8.85059C12.1176 8.84156 12.3056 8.90539 12.4531 9.02832L12.458 9.03125L12.498 9.06738L12.5029 9.07227L17.1719 13.7041L17.2656 13.8174C17.3483 13.9383 17.3954 14.081 17.3994 14.2295Z" fill="#7F7F7F" stroke="#7F7F7F" stroke-width="0.3" data-v-9a652e31></path></svg></div><div class="wrapper-overflow" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>复杂结构也能轻松清理；配合U1多打印头，换料清洗更少，省料又省时！</div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="mobile-button-group mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><button class="active mobile-tab-button" data-v-9a652e31>PETG 支撑：稳固承托，拆卸不伤面</button><button class="mobile-tab-button" data-v-9a652e31>PVA 水溶支撑：泡一泡就干净</button><!--]--></div><div class="mobile-content mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>PETG 在打印中更抗翘曲、支撑更稳；拆除更顺手，减少撬动与表面损伤。</div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="video-tab-section theme-dark" data-v-9a652e31><div class="block-text mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="u1-title" data-v-9a652e31>刚柔结合，一体易成型</div></div><div class="wrapper-video-list" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><div class="active wrapper-video" data-v-9a652e31><video src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Blend%20Rigid%20and%20Flexible%20Materials.webm" playsinline muted preload="none" data-v-9a652e31></video></div><div class="wrapper-video" data-v-9a652e31><video src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/shoe.webm" playsinline muted preload="none" data-v-9a652e31></video></div><!--]--></div><div class="wrapper-ct" data-v-9a652e31><div class="block-text desktop-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="u1-title" data-v-9a652e31>刚柔结合，一体易成型</div></div><div class="sub-text-group-list desktop-only" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><div class="active sub-text-group" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text" data-v-9a652e31><span data-v-9a652e31>PETG+TPU</span><svg class="icon-dropdown" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" data-v-9a652e31><circle opacity="0.1" cx="12" cy="12" r="12" transform="rotate(90 12 12)" fill="#DFDFDF" data-v-9a652e31></circle><path d="M17.3994 14.2295C17.4047 14.4275 17.3334 14.62 17.2002 14.7666C17.0668 14.9132 16.8814 15.0033 16.6836 15.0166C16.486 15.0298 16.2904 14.9662 16.1387 14.8389L16.1348 14.835L16.0957 14.7988L16.0898 14.7939L16.0908 14.793L11.9668 10.7021L7.91211 14.79C7.77697 14.9261 7.59583 15.0065 7.4043 15.0156C7.21246 15.0247 7.02353 14.9618 6.87598 14.8389L6.87207 14.835L6.83203 14.7988L6.82617 14.7939L6.82715 14.793C6.69113 14.6577 6.6096 14.4768 6.60059 14.2852C6.59168 14.0935 6.65543 13.9052 6.77832 13.7578L6.78125 13.7539L6.81738 13.7139L6.82227 13.708L6.82324 13.708L11.417 9.07715C11.5523 8.9409 11.734 8.85965 11.9258 8.85059C12.1176 8.84156 12.3056 8.90539 12.4531 9.02832L12.458 9.03125L12.498 9.06738L12.5029 9.07227L17.1719 13.7041L17.2656 13.8174C17.3483 13.9383 17.3954 14.081 17.3994 14.2295Z" fill="#7F7F7F" stroke="#7F7F7F" stroke-width="0.3" data-v-9a652e31></path></svg></div><div class="expanded wrapper-overflow" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>硬质 PETG 与柔性 TPU 同模成型，用于保护件、软铰链、穿戴部件等，不用分件粘接。</div><!----><!----></div></div><div class="sub-text-group" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text" data-v-9a652e31><span data-v-9a652e31>PLA+TPU：多颜色/硬度自由搭配</span><svg class="icon-dropdown" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" data-v-9a652e31><circle opacity="0.1" cx="12" cy="12" r="12" transform="rotate(90 12 12)" fill="#DFDFDF" data-v-9a652e31></circle><path d="M17.3994 14.2295C17.4047 14.4275 17.3334 14.62 17.2002 14.7666C17.0668 14.9132 16.8814 15.0033 16.6836 15.0166C16.486 15.0298 16.2904 14.9662 16.1387 14.8389L16.1348 14.835L16.0957 14.7988L16.0898 14.7939L16.0908 14.793L11.9668 10.7021L7.91211 14.79C7.77697 14.9261 7.59583 15.0065 7.4043 15.0156C7.21246 15.0247 7.02353 14.9618 6.87598 14.8389L6.87207 14.835L6.83203 14.7988L6.82617 14.7939L6.82715 14.793C6.69113 14.6577 6.6096 14.4768 6.60059 14.2852C6.59168 14.0935 6.65543 13.9052 6.77832 13.7578L6.78125 13.7539L6.81738 13.7139L6.82227 13.708L6.82324 13.708L11.417 9.07715C11.5523 8.9409 11.734 8.85965 11.9258 8.85059C12.1176 8.84156 12.3056 8.90539 12.4531 9.02832L12.458 9.03125L12.498 9.06738L12.5029 9.07227L17.1719 13.7041L17.2656 13.8174C17.3483 13.9383 17.3954 14.081 17.3994 14.2295Z" fill="#7F7F7F" stroke="#7F7F7F" stroke-width="0.3" data-v-9a652e31></path></svg></div><div class="wrapper-overflow" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>TPU 可按颜色与硬度组合；PLA 做过渡或临时支撑，易剥离不伤表面。</div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="mobile-button-group mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><!--[--><button class="active mobile-tab-button" data-v-9a652e31>PETG+TPU</button><button class="mobile-tab-button" data-v-9a652e31>PLA+TPU：多颜色/硬度自由搭配</button><!--]--></div><div class="mobile-content mobile-only" data-v-9a652e31><div class="text-sm" data-v-9a652e31>硬质 PETG 与柔性 TPU 同模成型，用于保护件、软铰链、穿戴部件等，不用分件粘接。</div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="custom-hero-section"><div class="custom-hero-content"><h2 class="custom-hero-title" style="color:#ffcd00;">丝滑打印，从智能校准开始</h2><div class="custom-hero-desc" style="color:#c2c2c2;">一台机器要驱动 4 枚打印头高速运转，必然要在精度上做到极致。U1 的补偿算法精准同步多打印头，有效抑制震动，精确控制挤出，并自动调平打印平台，带来媲美顶级单头打印机的<span class='desc-bold'>顺滑质感与高还原度</span>。</div></div></div><section class="video-text-section reverse-layout" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>多头偏移校准</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>U1 可自动校准各打印头的 XYZ 偏移，精度控制在 0.04mm<sup>[5]</sup> 以内，确保打印成品<strong>特征清晰、细节分明，无垂直错位</strong>。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><!----></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section><section class="video-text-section" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>振动补偿，稳定如一</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>输入整形（Input Shaping）技术可在高精度加速度传感器的辅助下，通过对运动指令进行预处理来抵消共振频率，从而减少因快速方向变化而产生的振动。U1 通过调整加速度曲线并引入一定的延迟，能够有效避免鬼影、波纹等表面缺陷，即使在高速打印下，也能呈现<strong>干净的边缘、平滑的壁面与锐利的细节</strong>。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="image-container" data-v-cff1cc89><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="振动补偿，稳定如一" loading="lazy" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img2.webp 1x, https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img2.webp 2x" class="section-image clickable" src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img2.webp" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="zoom-hint" data-v-cff1cc89><svg class="zoom-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-cff1cc89><path d="M21 21L16.514 16.506M19 10.5C19 15.194 15.194 19 10.5 19S2 15.194 2 10.5 5.806 2 10.5 2 19 5.806 19 10.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-cff1cc89></path><path d="M13.5 10.5H7.5M10.5 7.5V13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-cff1cc89></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section><section class="video-text-section reverse-layout" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>精准挤出，细节尽显</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>U1 借助压力提前（Pressure Advance）技术“预判”耗材挤出时的延迟。无论是加速移动还是锐角转角，U1 都能基于打印头的运动节奏流畅、稳定地挤出耗材， <strong>减少过挤和欠挤瑕疵，带来清晰、统一的细节效果</strong>。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><!----></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section><section class="video-text-section" style="background-color:transparent;" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="container" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="content-wrapper" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="text-half" data-v-cff1cc89><h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;" data-v-cff1cc89>首层打印依然重要</h2><p class="section-description" style="color:#BFBFBF;" data-v-cff1cc89>自动网格式热床调平确保<strong>首层平整、牢固</strong>，为每一次打印奠定完美基础。</p></div><div class="media-half" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="image-container" data-v-cff1cc89><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="首层打印依然重要" loading="lazy" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img4.webp 1x, https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img4.webp 2x" class="section-image clickable" src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/u1_pc_img4.webp" data-v-cff1cc89><div class="zoom-hint" data-v-cff1cc89><svg class="zoom-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-cff1cc89><path d="M21 21L16.514 16.506M19 10.5C19 15.194 15.194 19 10.5 19S2 15.194 2 10.5 5.806 2 10.5 2 19 5.806 19 10.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-cff1cc89></path><path d="M13.5 10.5H7.5M10.5 7.5V13.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-cff1cc89></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></section></div><!--[--><div class="snmk-container mt-3xl" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="do-in-one" data-v-2d8d86b8><h2 class="page-t-c page-t1" style="color:#1F1F1F;" data-v-2d8d86b8>耗材管理更轻松，创作更尽兴</h2><div class="dio-desc page-f1" style="color:#5C5C5C;" data-v-2d8d86b8>U1 配备了紧凑小巧的自动耗材系统，可同时装载 4 卷耗材。从检测到进料全程自动化，耗材管理 0 负担，让你轻松打印出绚丽多彩的作品。</div></div></div></div><div class="snmk-container" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="dio-video" data-v-2d8d86b8><video muted autoplay webkit-playsinline playsinline loop data-v-2d8d86b8><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Effortless%20Filament%20Management.webm" data-v-2d8d86b8></video></div></div></div><!----><!--]--><div class="section-wrapper swiper-horizontal-options-bg-g" ismobtitlefix="false" data-v-ae44349a><div class="container" data-v-ae44349a><!----><div class="content-section" data-v-ae44349a><div class="order-first options-section" data-v-ae44349a><!----><!----><div class="options-list" id="u1-snap-swap-features" data-v-ae44349a><div class="progress-bars" data-v-ae44349a><!--[--><div class="active progress-bar" data-v-ae44349a></div><div class="progress-bar" data-v-ae44349a></div><div class="progress-bar" data-v-ae44349a></div><!--]--></div><div class="options-content" data-v-ae44349a><!--[--><div class="active option-item" data-v-ae44349a><div class="option-title" data-v-ae44349a>自动进料</div><div class="option-description" style="display:block;" data-v-ae44349a>不用手动穿耗材，不用反复拉扯，更不用凭感觉判断耗材有没有送对通道。挂上耗材，剩下的交给 U1。</div></div><div class="option-item" data-v-ae44349a><div class="option-title" data-v-ae44349a>备份模式</div><div class="option-description" style="display:none;" data-v-ae44349a>快用完的耗材总让人纠结：用了怕断料，不用又怕浪费。开启备用模式后，当一卷耗材耗尽，U1 会自动切换到匹配的备用卷，让这烦恼彻底成为过去。</div></div><div class="option-item" data-v-ae44349a><div class="option-title" data-v-ae44349a>RFID 识别</div><div class="option-description" style="display:none;" data-v-ae44349a>U1 通过 RFID 技术自动识别 Snapmaker 官方耗材的颜色、类型等参数，无需手动输入。</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="order-last media-section" data-v-ae44349a><div class="media-container" data-v-ae44349a><!--[--><!--[--><video muted preload="metadata" playsinline class="active media-item" data-v-ae44349a><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/snap-pc-feat1.webm" data-v-ae44349a><!----></video><!--]--><!--[--><video muted preload="metadata" playsinline class="media-item" data-v-ae44349a><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/backup-pc.webm" data-v-ae44349a><!----></video><!--]--><!--[--><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/u1/swiper-pc-hor1.webp" alt="Auto toolhead alignment system" class="media-item" loading="lazy" data-v-ae44349a><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></div></div></div><!----></div><section class="swiper-base-section" data-v-61548304><div class="header-section" data-v-61548304><h2 class="section-title" data-v-61548304></h2><p class="section-description" data-v-61548304></p></div><div class="carousel-container" id="swiper-base" data-v-61548304><div class="carousel-wrapper" style="transform:translateX(-0%);gap:20px;" data-v-61548304><!--[--><!--]--></div><div style="display:none;" class="nav-arrows" data-v-61548304><button class="arrow-btn prev-btn" data-v-61548304><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" data-v-61548304><circle opacity="0.2" cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="black" data-v-61548304></circle><path d="M26.8995 14.1005L17 24L26.8995 33.8995" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-61548304></path></svg></button><button class="arrow-btn next-btn" data-v-61548304><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" data-v-61548304><circle opacity="0.2" cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="black" data-v-61548304></circle><path d="M21.1005 33.8995L31 24L21.1005 14.1005" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-v-61548304></path></svg></button></div></div><!----></section><section class="hero-img-banner hero-img-banner--content hero-img-banner--has-image anormaly-detection-and-alert" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__container--top hero-img-banner__container" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__text-content" data-v-83b25586><h2 class="hero-img-banner__title" style="color:#1a1a1a;" data-v-83b25586><span data-v-83b25586>异常检测与提醒</span></h2><div class="hero-img-banner__desc" style="color:#666;" data-v-83b25586><div data-v-83b25586>U1 集成十余枚传感器与精密机械结构，可自动检测异常，并提供快速修复方案建议，确保每一次打印都顺畅成功。</div></div><!----></div><div class="hero-img-banner__image-content" data-v-83b25586><picture class="hero-img-banner__picture" data-v-83b25586><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn.snapmaker.com/assets/snapmaker-u1/mob_Start%20Printing%20Right%20Away.webp" data-v-83b25586><!----><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Anormaly%20Detection%20and%20Alert.webp" alt="异常检测与提醒" class="hero-img-banner__image" data-v-83b25586></picture></div></div></section><!--[--><div class="snmk-container mt-3xl" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="do-in-one" data-v-2d8d86b8><h2 class="page-t-c page-t1" style="color:#1F1F1F;" data-v-2d8d86b8>捕捉精彩，拒绝遗憾</h2><div class="dio-desc page-f1" style="color:#595959;" data-v-2d8d86b8>U1 内置摄像头不仅仅是为了拍摄延时视频。计划于 2025 年 12 月推送的 OTA 固件更新<sup>[6]</sup> 将为其加入 AI 辅助打印监控功能，可自动识别“炒面”和打印平台异物，并在 Snapmaker Orca 或 App 中发出提醒，避免浪费时间和耗材。</div></div></div></div><div class="snmk-container" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="snmk-col-10 snmk-col-l-10 snmk-col-m-8 snmk-col-s-4 snmk-col-xs-4 snmk-col-offset-1 snmk-col-l-offset-1" data-v-2d8d86b8><div class="dio-video" data-v-2d8d86b8><video muted autoplay webkit-playsinline playsinline loop data-v-2d8d86b8><source src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/Capture%20the%20Highlights,%20Skip%20the%20Messes.webm" data-v-2d8d86b8></video></div></div></div><!----><!--]--><section class="hero-img-banner hero-img-banner--content hero-img-banner--has-image" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__container--top hero-img-banner__container" data-v-83b25586><div class="hero-img-banner__text-content" data-v-83b25586><h2 class="hero-img-banner__title" style="" data-v-83b25586><span data-v-83b25586>CoreXY 架构，500mm/s 高速打印</span></h2><div class="hero-img-banner__desc" style="" data-v-83b25586><div data-v-83b25586>U1 采用 CoreXY 运动架构，配备轻量且坚固的碳纤维 X 轴导轨，打印速度最高可达 500mm/s，同时确保打印机能够在 270 × 270 × 270mm 的工作空间下始终维持高精度打印。</div></div><!----></div><div class="hero-img-banner__image-content" data-v-83b25586><picture class="hero-img-banner__picture" data-v-83b25586><!----><!----><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/CoreXY%20System%20with%20500mm.webp" alt="CoreXY 架构，500mm/s 高速打印" class="hero-img-banner__image" data-v-83b25586></picture></div></div></section><div class="creative-carousel-container" data-v-20dd8d2d><div class="header-section" data-v-20dd8d2d><h2 class="section-title" data-v-20dd8d2d>有 U1，灵感无处不在</h2><p class="section-description" data-v-20dd8d2d>无论是和家人共享创作时光，是打造个人专属的兴趣天地，还是用巧思点缀你的日常生活，U1 都能让这一切变得轻松有趣。</p></div><div class="main-carousel-wrapper" data-v-20dd8d2d><div class="swiper main-carousel" data-v-20dd8d2d><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide main-slide" data-v-20dd8d2d><!--[--><div class="slide-content" data-v-20dd8d2d><picture data-v-20dd8d2d><source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/assets/snapmaker-u1/mob_Home%20Use%20&amp;%20Toys.webp" data-v-20dd8d2d><img src="https://cdn1.snapmaker.cn/asse